# Smoke Coverage Audit — Part 3: Physical Domains & Core Math/Crypto Priority

File: openOODA/audit/smoke_coverage_audit_part3.oot
Logline: Surveys domain modules from Life Sciences to Misc and defines top-priority test targets for Crypto, Math, Collections, and Hash.

Setup: Enumerates physical and engineering domain subtrees, assigning concrete test strategies (KAT, RT, PROP, ALGO, PILLAR).

Beats:
  1. Domain rollup: Life sciences, finance, quantum, robotics, signal, GIS, embedded, test infra.
  2. Top-priority crypto and security modules (28 modules with test kinds).
  3. Top-priority math and extended math modules (16 modules).
  4. Top-priority collections and hash modules (15 modules).

