================================================================
BEAT 4 — TOP-PRIORITY MODULES PER DOMAIN (PART A)
================================================================

Each row gives: module path * top 1-3 public functions * test kind.
Test kind codes:
    KAT      Known-Answer Test (RFC / FIPS / Wycheproof vector)
    RT       Round-trip (encode->decode equals identity)
    PROP     Property-based (commutativity, idempotence, associativity)
    EDGE     Edge / boundary value (empty, zero, max-int, overflow)
    ALGO     Algorithm-specific (LAPACK residue, BER, polynomial eval)
    STREAM   Streaming / chunked behaviour
    CAP      Capability-gated (test the &Net/&Fs/&HttpCap path)
    PILLAR   Adversarial (Pillar 3 of START.oot: VALID+NT+ADV+DRY)

4.1  std/crypto  (52 modules — pick 14)

    Path                                         Top 1-3 fns                                  Test
    std/crypto/aes.oo                            aes_encrypt, aes_decrypt                     KAT (NIST AES-128 ECB)
    std/crypto/aes_gcm.oo                        aead_seal, aead_open                         KAT (RFC 5288 A.1)
    std/crypto/aes_inv.oo                        aes_inv_block                                KAT (inverse-cipher round trip)
    std/crypto/aead.oo                           aead_seal, aead_open                         KAT (variant selector)
    std/crypto/ecdsa.oo                          ecdsa_sign, ecdsa_verify                     KAT (RFC 6979 vector)
    std/crypto/ed25519.oo                        ed25519_sign, ed25519_verify                  KAT (RFC 8032 7.1 test 1)
    std/crypto/x25519.oo                         x25519_scalarmult                            KAT (RFC 7748 5.2)
    std/crypto/curve25519.oo                     curve25519_scalarmult                        KAT (RFC 7748 5.2 alt)
    std/crypto/kyber.oo                          kyber_keygen, kyber_encaps, kyber_decaps      KAT (FIPS 203 vector)
    std/crypto/hkdf.oo                           hkdf_extract, hkdf_expand                    KAT (RFC 5869 vector)
    std/crypto/hmac.oo                           hmac_sha256, hmac_sha512                     KAT (RFC 4231 vector)
    std/crypto/merkle.oo                         merkle_root, merkle_proof                    PROP (insertion + proof)
    std/crypto/poly1305.oo                       poly1305_mac                                 KAT (RFC 8439 2.5.2)
    std/crypto/argon2.oo                         argon2_hash                                  KAT (PHC string roundtrip)

